    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>\nTo <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>—<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI leave you my Lucario as a symbol of my gratitude\nand respect.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis Lucario was given to me by a certain Trainer\nwho hoped it might keep me safe.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf you should ever meet her, please tell her that I\nkept it with me until the end.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI must tell you that I have found you to be a\nPokémon Trainer of the highest caliber.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIn all my three thousand years wandering this\nworld, never did I imagine I might encounter a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhuman who would achieve Mega Evolution<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwith Zygarde.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI find so many memories flit through my mind\nnow, here at the end of things...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI remember my mother giving me my Floette,\ngrasping her rare black flower.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI remember the flames of war taking everything\nfrom me.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI remember the amazement, the joy of witnessing\nMega Evolution for the first time.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI remember my encounters with the Legendary\nPokémon of Kalos.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI remember when that dark day fell over Galar...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAll that falls into the past disappears. These\nmemories will fade. As will I.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYour story is only just beginning, dear\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npray<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthat<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwill<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlive<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlife<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfree<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfrom<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nregret.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI am truly glad to have known you.          \nThank you.",
